{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"tokens":[{"text":"- (","kind":"text"},{"text":"void","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:v"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"update","kind":"identifier"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"languages":["occ"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Use this method to update the appearance of the user location annotation. This","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"method is called by the associated map view when it has determined that the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"user location annotation needs to be updated. This can happen in response to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"user interaction, a change in the user’s location, when the user tracking mode","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"changes, or when the viewport changes.","type":"text"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"During user interaction with the map, this method may be called many"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"times to update the user location annotation. Therefore, your implementation of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"this method should be as lightweight as possible to avoid negatively affecting"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"performance."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"Note"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"metadata":{"title":"update","symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"update","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"update","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNUserLocationAnnotationView(im)update","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}]},"sections":[]